					"embedType": "twitter",
					"html": "<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">初戦突破！シングルエリミ超緊張する😂 <a href=\"https://t.co/tZHEy10Fpm\">pic.twitter.com/tZHEy10Fpm</a></p>&mdash; たねのぶ (@mtane0412) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mtane0412/status/1835170306484572487?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">September 15, 2024</a></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"></script>\n\n",
