						"author_url": "https://twitter.com/mtane0412",
						"html": "<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet\"><p lang=\"ja\" dir=\"ltr\">3回戦突破！次配信台らしい！ <a href=\"https://t.co/xCKsDe4CJP\">pic.twitter.com/xCKsDe4CJP</a></p>&mdash; たねのぶ (@mtane0412) <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mtane0412/status/1835179884752085351?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">September 15, 2024</a></blockquote>\n<script async src=\"https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"></script>\n\n",
						"width": 550,
